WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:07.754
Reports shows what your child has practised. Choose 7, 14, 30 or 90 days.

00:08.353 --> 00:14.762
Is it working compares today with the past, so you can see which units moved up a level.

00:15.361 --> 00:21.516
The charts show minutes per day and how many answers were right on the first try.

00:21.516 --> 00:23.720
Every chart has a table view.

00:24.320 --> 00:30.589
Strengths and Worth practising point to what to celebrate and what to practise next.

00:31.189 --> 00:36.936
Every unit lists each level. These reflect practice, not a report-card mark.

00:36.936 --> 00:40.036
Your child's teacher decides proficiency.
